# Only send application sources and build inputs to Docker.
*
!backend/
!backend/**
!frontend/
!frontend/**
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# Never bake credentials or local development artifacts into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/*.tsbuildinfo
